[{"answer":"Good morning. City House Services. How may I help you?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-21-2019-03-29-04-47-46/1.mp3"},{"answer":"Good morning. I'd like to arrange to have my house cleaned.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-21-2019-03-29-04-47-46/2.mp3"},{"answer":"Certainly. I just need to ask a few questions.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-21-2019-03-29-04-47-46/3.mp3"},{"answer":"First, could I take your name?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-21-2019-03-29-04-47-46/4.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, it's Barbara Hill.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-21-2019-03-29-04-47-46/5.mp3"},{"answer":"Thank you. Next, is your house in London?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-21-2019-03-29-04-47-46/6.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, it's in Kingston in Southwest London.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-21-2019-03-29-04-47-46/7.mp3"},{"answer":"OK, Southwest London and... er, what's the postcode?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-21-2019-03-29-04-47-46/8.mp3"},{"answer":"SW105.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-21-2019-03-29-04-47-46/9.mp3"},{"answer":"And what is the square footage and what rooms will we be cleaning?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-21-2019-03-29-04-47-46/10.mp3"},{"answer":"The whole house is 268 square feet,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-21-2019-03-29-04-47-46/11.mp3"},{"answer":"and there is no need to clean all the rooms.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-21-2019-03-29-04-47-46/12.mp3"},{"answer":"I only want to have my bedrooms cleaned.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-21-2019-03-29-04-47-46/13.mp3"},{"answer":"OK, how many bedrooms does the house have?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-21-2019-03-29-04-47-46/14.mp3"},{"answer":"3 bedrooms.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-21-2019-03-29-04-47-46/15.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh no, sorry, we used to have 3 bedrooms, but we only have 2 bedrooms now.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-21-2019-03-29-04-47-46/16.mp3"},{"answer":"Are those single bedrooms or doubles?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-21-2019-03-29-04-47-46/17.mp3"},{"answer":"Doubles.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-21-2019-03-29-04-47-46/18.mp3"},{"answer":"Fine, 2 doubles...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-21-2019-03-29-04-47-46/19.mp3"},{"answer":"There's one more room which needs cleaning.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-21-2019-03-29-04-47-46/20.mp3"},{"answer":"It was used as a bedroom before, and now we have converted it into an office.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-21-2019-03-29-04-47-46/21.mp3"},{"answer":"I understand.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-21-2019-03-29-04-47-46/22.mp3"},{"answer":"3 rooms have got to be cleaned, and are all of those rooms upstairs?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-21-2019-03-29-04-47-46/23.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes. Then, downstairs we have a kitchen-diner, conservatory, and lounge.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-21-2019-03-29-04-47-46/24.mp3"},{"answer":"The kitchen-diner is quite large and has the usual equipment:","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-21-2019-03-29-04-47-46/25.mp3"},{"answer":"cooker with oven, refrigerator, cupboards, and worktops.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-21-2019-03-29-04-47-46/26.mp3"},{"answer":"The conservatory has a lot of plants, but there's no need to take care of them.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-21-2019-03-29-04-47-46/27.mp3"},{"answer":"The lounge has a leather three-piece suite and a large coffee table.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-21-2019-03-29-04-47-46/28.mp3"},{"answer":"Thank you. And do you keep any pets?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-21-2019-03-29-04-47-46/29.mp3"},{"answer":"Yeah, I really love keeping them.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-21-2019-03-29-04-47-46/30.mp3"},{"answer":"I've got 2 dogs and 3 cats.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-21-2019-03-29-04-47-46/31.mp3"},{"answer":"OK, then if our staff come over to offer the service, please take your pets away.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-21-2019-03-29-04-47-46/32.mp3"},{"answer":"Have you looked at our service packages?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-21-2019-03-29-04-47-46/33-2019-05-15-14-44-21.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, I have one in front of me.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-21-2019-03-29-04-47-46/34.mp3"},{"answer":"Excellent.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-21-2019-03-29-04-47-46/35.mp3"},{"answer":"Any extra services you need,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-21-2019-03-29-04-47-46/36.mp3"},{"answer":"switching bed linen, working in the garden, cleaning the glass in the conservatory, that kind of thing?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-21-2019-03-29-04-47-46/37.mp3"},{"answer":"Err... no... err...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-21-2019-03-29-04-47-46/38.mp3"},{"answer":"actually, replacing the bed linen...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-21-2019-03-29-04-47-46/39.mp3"},{"answer":"yeah.. that would be good.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-21-2019-03-29-04-47-46/40.mp3"},{"answer":"No problem. I'll just make a note of that.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-21-2019-03-29-04-47-46/41.mp3"},{"answer":"How about curtains, mats, and carpets?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-21-2019-03-29-04-47-46/42.mp3"},{"answer":"What would you like us to do with those items?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-21-2019-03-29-04-47-46/43.mp3"},{"answer":"The curtains... I'll have to think about that.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-21-2019-03-29-04-47-46/44.mp3"},{"answer":"I think we should have the carpets cleaned really well every quarter.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-21-2019-03-29-04-47-46/45.mp3"},{"answer":"Mats can just be done with the laundry.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-21-2019-03-29-04-47-46/46.mp3"},{"answer":"Of course.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-21-2019-03-29-04-47-46/47.mp3"},{"answer":"How about clothes?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-21-2019-03-29-04-47-46/48.mp3"},{"answer":"We can have our staff wash and iron them,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-21-2019-03-29-04-47-46/49.mp3"},{"answer":"or we can have them taken to a dry cleaner.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-21-2019-03-29-04-47-46/50.mp3"},{"answer":"Washing and ironing. No, just ironing. That'll be OK.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-21-2019-03-29-04-47-46/51.mp3"},{"answer":"OK, fine. I know quite a bit about what you want now.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-21-2019-03-29-04-47-46/52.mp3"},{"answer":"I should let you know that we are located on 12 Amyes Road,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-21-2019-03-29-04-47-46/53.mp3"},{"answer":"that's A-M-Y-E-S.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-21-2019-03-29-04-47-46/54.mp3"},{"answer":"And we work on from Monday to Sunday except Tuesday and Wednesday.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-21-2019-03-29-04-47-46/55.mp3"},{"answer":"Could you let me know when is convenient for you?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-21-2019-03-29-04-47-46/56.mp3"},{"answer":"Next Friday...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-21-2019-03-29-04-47-46/57.mp3"},{"answer":"err... no, oh, that's no good.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-21-2019-03-29-04-47-46/58.mp3"},{"answer":"My son invites his friends over in the afternoon that day.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-21-2019-03-29-04-47-46/59.mp3"},{"answer":"Perhaps next Thursday or next Saturday.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-21-2019-03-29-04-47-46/60.mp3"},{"answer":"Let me check, OK, next Thursday.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-21-2019-03-29-04-47-46/61.mp3"},{"answer":"When is it convenient for us to come over and provide the service?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-21-2019-03-29-04-47-46/62.mp3"},{"answer":"Is it OK if we come in the morning?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-21-2019-03-29-04-47-46/63.mp3"},{"answer":"Or we may come in the afternoon? It depends on your schedule.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-21-2019-03-29-04-47-46/64.mp3"},{"answer":"I'm OK with any time.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-21-2019-03-29-04-47-46/65.mp3"},{"answer":"Just give me a call to let me know you're coming before you arrive.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-21-2019-03-29-04-47-46/66.mp3"},{"answer":"Sure, we will.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-21-2019-03-29-04-47-46/67.mp3"},{"answer":"By the way, how long will it take for the service?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-21-2019-03-29-04-47-46/68.mp3"},{"answer":"We usually work 1 to 3 hours for house cleaning,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-21-2019-03-29-04-47-46/69.mp3"},{"answer":"and the work will take 3 hours at most.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-21-2019-03-29-04-47-46/70.mp3"},{"answer":"And of course, if it takes more than 3 hours, you should pay extra for it.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-21-2019-03-29-04-47-46/71.mp3"},{"answer":"Er... fine.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-21-2019-03-29-04-47-46/72.mp3"},{"answer":"So, let me just do some calculations...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-21-2019-03-29-04-47-46/73.mp3"}]
